{"title":"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/5/ed59715543cb33b872cdc2223cea870166200919.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] unitsize(15mm);  size(5cm, 0);  pair A = (0,0); pair B = (4,0); pair C = (4,4); pair D = (0,4);  draw(A--B--C--D--cycle, linewidth(1pt) + black); draw(arc(D, 4, 0, -90), linewidth(1pt) + black); draw(arc((2,0), 2, 0, 180), linewidth(1pt)+black); draw(circle((3.2,0.64),0.64),linewidth(1pt)+black); draw((3.2,0.64)--(3.2,0),linewidth(1pt)+black); label(&quot;$A$&quot;, A, SW); label(&quot;$B$&quot;, B, SE); label(&quot;$C$&quot;, C, NE); label(&quot;$D$&quot;, D, NW); label(&quot;300&quot;,(2,0),S); label(&quot;300&quot;,(0,2),W); label(&quot;$r$&quot;,(3.2,0.32),E); [/asy]\" width=\"345\" height=\"328\" /></center>\n<p>A circle with radius <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is externally tangent to a quarter circle inscribed in a square with radius <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/9/b899aba26cc33f0026125daebb44a60349c999b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$300$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" />, and is internally tangent to an inscribed semicircle with radius <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/e/f5e10e5f3aa7c766cb27c3ad319fa526f71588cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$150$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" />, as shown in the figure above. Find the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/c/98c5cc3e39b968e73d2f3d4d8aa1c6bb192043c3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] unitsize(15mm);  size(5cm, 0);  pair A = (0,0); pair B = (4,0); pair C = (4,4); pair D = (0,4); pair incenter = (3.2,0.64); draw(A--B--C--D--cycle, linewidth(1pt) + black); draw(arc(D, 4, 0, -90), linewidth(1pt) + black); draw(arc((2,0), 2, 0, 180), linewidth(1pt)+black); draw(circle(incenter,0.64),linewidth(1pt)+black); draw(incenter--(3.2,0),linewidth(1pt)+black); draw(incenter--D,linewidth(1pt)+black); draw((2,0)--(3.7614,0.9473),linewidth(1pt)+black); draw((0,0.64)--(0.16,0.64)--(0.16,0.80)--(0,0.80)--cycle,linewidth(0.5pt)+black); draw((3.2,0)--(3.04,0)--(3.04,0.16)--(3.2,0.16)--cycle,linewidth(0.5pt)+black); label(&quot;$A$&quot;, A, SW); label(&quot;$B$&quot;, B, SE); label(&quot;$C$&quot;, C, NE); label(&quot;$D$&quot;, D, NW); label(&quot;300&quot;,(0,2),W);  dot(&quot;Q&quot;,(2,0),S); dot(&quot;$P$&quot;,incenter,SE,fontsize(10pt)); dot(&quot;$S$&quot;, (3.2,0), S); dot(&quot;$T$&quot;, (0,0.64), W); draw((0,0.64)--incenter, linewidth(1pt) + black + dotted); label(&quot;$r$&quot;, ((3.2+0.3),(0.64+0.2)),NW); [/asy]\" width=\"345\" height=\"332\" /></center>\n<p>Notice that \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/3/09355045bc0cf6bf9195082a8fd9577b14643e97.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\overline{PQ}&amp;=150-r\\\\  \\overline{PS}&amp;=r  \\\\  \\overline{DP}&amp;=300+r \\\\   \\overline{DT}&amp;=300-r \\\\  \\overline{PT}&amp;=\\overline{AQ}+\\overline{QS}=150+\\overline{QS} \\end{align*}\" width=\"231\" height=\"133\" />\nBy the Pythagorean Theorem,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/a/c5a4c9c7744400fa5862ef6043711c3c69129245.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(\\overline{QS})^2+(\\overline{PS})^2=(\\overline{PQ})^2\\]\" width=\"190\" height=\"20\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/5/3a5969526e3c1ff92899afeb1c9ca1fa04152441.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(\\overline{QS})^2+r^2=(150-r)^2=22500-300r+r^2 \\implies \\overline{QS}=10\\sqrt{225-3r}\\]\" width=\"538\" height=\"20\" />\nSimilarly,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/3/a5313aa0494bdf5125c9011cc0c486238bb7be58.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} (\\overline{DT})^2+(\\overline{PT})^2&amp;=(\\overline{PD})^2 \\\\ (300-r)^2+(150+10\\sqrt{225-3r})^2&amp;=(300+r)^2 \\\\ (90000-600r+r^2)+(22500+3000\\sqrt{225-3r}+22500-300r)&amp;=(r^2+600r+90000) \\\\ 45000+3000\\sqrt{225-3r}&amp;=1500r \\\\ 2\\sqrt{225-3r}&amp;=r-30 \\\\ (2\\sqrt{225-3r})^2&amp;=(r-30)^2 \\\\  900-12r&amp;=r^2-60r+900 \\\\ (r)(r-48)&amp;=0 \\end{align*}\" width=\"681\" height=\"219\" />\nSince clearly <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/b/14b70e545bcf8a03b178621ec62a0285b2659305.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r\\neq0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"41\" height=\"17\" />, we get that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/0/df04a02f31290846ae029ed6c45c9b5c0ecebddf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r=\\boxed{48}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"64\" height=\"25\" />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO\">2026 Indonesia District MO </a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?t